<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδώ</span></b> , ἡ, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όος</span>
		
			contr.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦς</span>, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῖ</span>,
			<u>Sardinia</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.170
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>V.</u>
			700
		</span></i>; the obl. cases are sts. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδόνος,
			-όνι, -όνα</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδών</span>), <i><span class="en">
			Plb.
			1.24.5
		</span></i> sq., <i><span class="en">
			1.79.1
		</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδῶνος</span> is f.l.
			in
		<i><span class="en">
			Str.
			2.4.3
		</span></i>: a nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδώνη</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>(s.v.l.).-Hence Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδόνιος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.166
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			16.86
		</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρδάνιος</span> (hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδονία</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδώ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2509.14
			</span></i>):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδονικός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i><i>Mete..</i><i><span class="en">
				354a21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.26
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδώνιος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.5.19
			</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδωνικός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				796
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδῷος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῴα, ῷον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.42.6
			</span></i>, etc.:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδοί</span></b> , οἱ, <i>the
			Sardinians</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				21.16
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδῷοι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				88.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς τῆς
		λεγομένης</span></div>
